From 433e481a7e4ca80d0fd0f4cd6ea8324f6632f9b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kelvin Lee <kelvin.cushman@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 22:03:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(banner): ORPHUS wordmark startup banner

Replaces the Atomic forall-A with a 50-column ORPHUS wordmark in ANSI-shadow
block style. Keeps the two-half assembly animation (split at column 25) and
the shadow pass, and adds a two-tone treatment: solid blocks render bold in
the theme accent, box-drawing outline glyphs render dim for digital depth.
Honors NO_COLOR.
